1
00:00:48,950 --> 00:00:53,030
[The Old Story of Yu Hong]

2
00:00:53,390 --> 00:00:56,000
[Episode 15]

3
00:01:17,539 --> 00:01:18,210
Hello, Auntie.

4
00:01:43,850 --> 00:01:45,610
You've done so much for me.

5
00:01:46,430 --> 00:01:48,200
How do you want me to repay you?

6
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:08,490
You like me, don't you?

7
00:02:22,190 --> 00:02:23,640
But my current condition

8
00:02:25,040 --> 00:02:26,530
won't allow it.

9
00:02:29,329 --> 00:02:30,370
That's not what I meant.

10
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:35,470
Really.

11
00:03:15,080 --> 00:03:15,860
Once I save enough money,

12
00:03:15,860 --> 00:03:17,750
I'll take you down south for surgery.

13
00:03:19,579 --> 00:03:20,860
We'll get on the train from Tiecheng,

14
00:03:21,650 --> 00:03:22,810
then pass through Liaoyang.

15
00:03:23,620 --> 00:03:26,130
Then Anshan, Haicheng,

16
00:03:27,560 --> 00:03:29,210
Xiliu, Panjin.

17
00:03:30,130 --> 00:03:32,150
When we're hungry,
we'll go to Goubangzi for roast chicken.

18
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:33,870
After eating roast chicken,

19
00:03:34,130 --> 00:03:35,210
we'll arrive in Jinzhou.

20
00:03:35,430 --> 00:03:35,970
Then...

21
00:03:35,970 --> 00:03:36,750
Huludao,

22
00:03:37,210 --> 00:03:38,120
Xingcheng,

23
00:03:38,430 --> 00:03:39,340
Suizhong.

24
00:03:42,340 --> 00:03:44,560
Once we pass Shanhaiguan and Qinhuangdao,

25
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:46,620
we'll be out of Northeast China.

26
00:03:48,340 --> 00:03:49,680
Then Tianjin,

27
00:03:50,250 --> 00:03:51,240
Cangzhou,

28
00:03:51,780 --> 00:03:52,680
Dezhou,

29
00:03:53,370 --> 00:03:54,240
Yanzhou,

30
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:56,360
Xuzhou,

31
00:03:56,910 --> 00:03:57,690
Bengbu.

32
00:04:00,090 --> 00:04:01,630
Once we cross the Yangtze River Bridge,

33
00:04:02,210 --> 00:04:03,560
we'll be in the south.

34
00:04:06,870 --> 00:04:08,310
You can recite all that?

35
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:14,440
His wings

36
00:04:15,070 --> 00:04:17,260
became like polished blades.

37
00:04:18,630 --> 00:04:21,100
The shriek of cutting through the air

38
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:23,950
turned into a joyful murmur.

39
00:04:55,740 --> 00:04:56,630
What does that mean?

40
00:05:33,170 --> 00:05:34,350
I should get going.

41
00:05:37,570 --> 00:05:38,390
I bought movie tickets!

42
00:05:38,390 --> 00:05:39,180
Don't forget!

43
00:05:56,420 --> 00:05:58,000
Go to the station from Waterloo Bridge.

44
00:05:58,270 --> 00:05:59,380
Waterloo Bridge?

45
00:06:01,370 --> 00:06:02,420
There's still enough time.

46
00:06:03,370 --> 00:06:03,890
Okay.

47
00:06:08,050 --> 00:06:10,010
Drive the car to the other side
of the bridge and wait for me.

48
00:06:10,030 --> 00:06:11,800
I'll walk over, okay?

49
00:06:58,920 --> 00:06:59,720
This is for you.

50
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:03,940
A lucky charm?

51
00:07:05,070 --> 00:07:06,870
Maybe it will bring you luck.

52
00:07:08,070 --> 00:07:09,160
I think it will.

53
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:11,190
I really hope it will.

54
00:07:14,270 --> 00:07:15,510
You are so nice.

55
00:07:15,510 --> 00:07:17,180
You won't forget me now, right?

56
00:07:17,180 --> 00:07:18,800
You won't forget me now, right?

57
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:20,750
I don't think so.

58
00:07:20,770 --> 00:07:21,460
I don't think so.

59
00:07:21,490 --> 00:07:22,500
I won't.

60
00:07:23,270 --> 00:07:23,980
I won't.

61
00:07:24,860 --> 00:07:26,740
I will never forget you
for the rest of my life.

62
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:57,750
I loved you.

63
00:07:57,080 --> 00:08:01,430
[1998]

64
00:07:59,020 --> 00:08:00,920
I've never loved anyone else.

65
00:08:01,430 --> 00:08:02,390
[1988]

66
00:08:02,220 --> 00:08:03,450
And I never will.

67
00:08:02,390 --> 00:08:04,810
[1978]

68
00:08:05,020 --> 00:08:06,970
That's the truth, Roy.

69
00:08:08,420 --> 00:08:10,070
I never will.

70
00:08:11,450 --> 00:08:14,050
[Hao Fang, Hao Jie's mother]

71
00:08:19,340 --> 00:08:21,920
[Liu Weiguo, Liu Yang's father]

72
00:08:38,620 --> 00:08:41,220
[Guangming Theater]

73
00:08:41,220 --> 00:08:45,190
[Shanghai]

74
00:08:59,950 --> 00:09:07,800
[Guangming Theater]

75
00:09:32,300 --> 00:09:33,070
Wait a minute.

76
00:09:36,800 --> 00:09:37,730
Wait a minute.

77
00:09:40,580 --> 00:09:41,480
I'll have this.

78
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:43,100
How much?

79
00:09:43,170 --> 00:09:43,980
0.2 yuan.

80
00:09:44,500 --> 00:09:45,240
Thank you.

81
00:09:51,390 --> 00:09:52,840
I saw this was selling pretty well.

82
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:54,290
Didn't you skip dinner?

83
00:10:17,790 --> 00:10:18,270
Fang.

84
00:10:50,140 --> 00:10:55,820
[Fang]

85
00:11:06,130 --> 00:11:07,640
When will you go back?

86
00:11:09,020 --> 00:11:15,090
[Boiled Water]

87
00:11:09,830 --> 00:11:10,620
When...

88
00:11:11,270 --> 00:11:12,790
When will you go back?

89
00:11:14,210 --> 00:11:15,570
I just arrived today.

90
00:11:20,100 --> 00:11:28,550
[Boiled Water]

91
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:23,840
Is...

92
00:11:24,580 --> 00:11:26,150
-Is everything okay with your family?
-Is everything okay with your family?

93
00:11:51,510 --> 00:11:52,910
It's been 7 years.

94
00:11:53,390 --> 00:11:54,770
I... I've always...

95
00:11:55,870 --> 00:11:56,600
carried it with me.

96
00:11:59,270 --> 00:12:01,410
I thought I'd never see you again.

97
00:12:03,980 --> 00:12:05,770
I never expected
that in this life I can still...

98
00:12:08,840 --> 00:12:10,240
Excuse me. Excuse me. Excuse me.

99
00:12:12,750 --> 00:12:15,260
Do you know how to ride a bike?
Be careful.

100
00:14:43,780 --> 00:14:45,790
Why didn't I hear from you later?

101
00:14:46,720 --> 00:14:47,910
The machine tool factory I was sent to

102
00:14:47,910 --> 00:14:49,360
took on a confidential project.

103
00:14:49,630 --> 00:14:51,610
We weren't allowed to contact the outside.

104
00:14:52,340 --> 00:14:53,800
Everyone said

105
00:14:54,200 --> 00:14:56,000
you had a lover over there.

106
00:14:57,960 --> 00:15:00,280
My parents were worried
I'd never get married,

107
00:15:00,320 --> 00:15:01,930
so they wouldn't let me
wait for you anymore.

108
00:15:03,750 --> 00:15:05,730
I accepted the factory's arrangement

109
00:15:06,030 --> 00:15:07,980
after you got married.

110
00:15:09,270 --> 00:15:10,540
I heard you married

111
00:15:11,050 --> 00:15:12,340
an educated youth from Shanghai.

112
00:15:13,310 --> 00:15:15,280
I really didn't want to live anymore.

113
00:15:28,400 --> 00:15:31,050
Why did you use my flannel
to wipe your hands again?

114
00:15:32,920 --> 00:15:34,700
There's so much hair on the floor.

115
00:15:35,040 --> 00:15:36,490
Can't you see it?

116
00:15:37,080 --> 00:15:37,840
You don't clean here,

117
00:15:37,840 --> 00:15:38,650
and you don't clean there either.

118
00:15:38,650 --> 00:15:40,030
What do you even do at home?

119
00:15:40,530 --> 00:15:41,960
Look at Mrs. Chen next door.

120
00:15:41,960 --> 00:15:43,780
She's a real all-rounder.

121
00:15:44,100 --> 00:15:45,340
Can't you learn from her?

122
00:15:49,130 --> 00:15:50,600
Relatives from my hometown came here.

123
00:15:50,890 --> 00:15:52,580
I need to entertain them tomorrow.

124
00:15:53,270 --> 00:15:53,860
What?

125
00:15:54,910 --> 00:15:57,150
Don't bring your relatives home.

126
00:15:57,960 --> 00:15:59,720
It's too cramped here.
There's no room for everyone to sit.

127
00:16:00,220 --> 00:16:01,170
They're from out of town.

128
00:16:01,170 --> 00:16:02,890
Why don't you
take them somewhere else, okay?

129
00:16:21,200 --> 00:16:22,220
For God's sake.

130
00:16:22,220 --> 00:16:24,520
There's oil dripping
all around the kerosene stove.

131
00:16:24,600 --> 00:16:26,360
Are you trying to take years off my life?

132
00:16:34,860 --> 00:16:36,310
This is Nanjing Road.

133
00:16:36,640 --> 00:16:38,310
Over there is Tibet Road.

134
00:16:38,340 --> 00:16:39,980
I'll show you around there later.

135
00:16:42,630 --> 00:16:45,950
[Dashijie Department Store]

136
00:16:44,580 --> 00:16:46,100
The cookie box
isn't sealed properly again.

137
00:16:46,460 --> 00:16:48,150
If they go stale, it'll all go to waste.

138
00:16:48,150 --> 00:16:49,640
And the watermelon rind.

139
00:16:49,960 --> 00:16:52,560
I told you to keep it to cook a dish.

140
00:16:54,530 --> 00:16:56,290
Cut the tomatoes smaller.

141
00:16:56,290 --> 00:16:57,780
Make a couple more dishes.

142
00:17:02,700 --> 00:17:04,510
You're smiling like a fool.

143
00:17:09,750 --> 00:17:10,200
Let's go.

144
00:17:10,849 --> 00:17:12,380
Let's go in and take a look.

145
00:17:12,569 --> 00:17:13,790
The ticket is 0.1 yuan.

146
00:17:13,790 --> 00:17:14,440
It's fine.

147
00:17:14,440 --> 00:17:14,960
Let's go.

148
00:17:14,960 --> 00:17:16,000
It's too expensive.

149
00:17:15,420 --> 00:17:19,530
[Entrance, Ticket: 0.1 yuan]

150
00:17:16,060 --> 00:17:17,089
Let's go.

151
00:17:29,970 --> 00:17:38,330
[Hujiang]

152
00:17:37,400 --> 00:17:38,440
Does it look good?

153
00:17:41,280 --> 00:17:42,010
Fang.

154
00:17:44,530 --> 00:17:45,090
In my heart,

155
00:17:45,090 --> 00:17:47,010
you're prettier than the mannequin
in the display window.

156
00:17:49,350 --> 00:17:51,390
I won't look pretty when I'm old.

157
00:17:56,700 --> 00:17:59,220
I might not even get to see you
when you're old.

158
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:06,500
Let's go.

159
00:18:07,050 --> 00:18:07,940
I'll take you somewhere.

160
00:18:09,930 --> 00:18:12,940
[Hujiang]

161
00:18:12,110 --> 00:18:13,040
Closer.

162
00:18:15,910 --> 00:18:17,170
A little closer.

163
00:18:20,790 --> 00:18:22,270
A little closer.

164
00:18:27,090 --> 00:18:28,640
Okay, don't move.

165
00:18:29,460 --> 00:18:30,070
One.

166
00:18:30,680 --> 00:18:31,480
Two.

167
00:18:32,010 --> 00:18:32,550
Three.
